Otegami depends on the third-party open source software listed below,
pulled in via Swift Package Manager directly or transitively from
packages/OtegamiKit/Package.swift. None of it is vendored into this
repository; SwiftPM fetches and builds it from source at the pinned
revisions recorded in Package.resolved.

